; a history — modular synthesis, one night at a time
; •• + the rocker rides between the scenes; the faders are written next to each scene

1964 the moog room
------------------
; a clock, a melody that rewrites itself, a ladder filter. fader1 cutoff, fader2 how much it changes
the clock is clock 4
the book is turing 8
the osc is vco 2
the filter is ladder 1
the env is adsr

clock.eighth -> book.clock env.gate
book -40> osc.pitch
osc -> filter
env -> filter.cutoff
fader1 -> filter.cutoff
fader2 -> book.change
filter -> out leds

1965 the buchla basement
------------------------
; west coast: a complex oscillator, folds, bongos from Euclidean pulses. fader1 timbre, fader2 hits
the clock is clock 4
the steps are euclid 13
the voice is crossfm 2
the peaks are folder
the gate is lpg
the drift is randomwalk 1

clock.eighth -> steps.clock
steps.hit >| gate.level
fader2 -> steps.hits
drift ~> voice.index
fader1 -> voice.fold peaks.fold
voice -> peaks -> gate -> out leds

1974 serge night
----------------
; a slope that cycles, a comparator and a frequency shifter. fader1 shift, fader2 slope
the slope is slope
the cmp is comparator
the osc is vco 4
the portal is freqshift 1

slope.end -> slope.trig
fader2 -> slope.rise slope.fall
slope -> cmp
40 -> cmp.ref
cmp.gate -> osc.sync
osc.tri -> portal
fader1 -> portal.shift
portal.up -> left
portal.down -> right
slope -> leds.track

1980 the drum machine party
---------------------------
; a map of beats and three drums. fader1 x, fader2 y, fader3 density
the clock is clock 4
the beats are drummap
the kick is kick 1
the snare is snare 1
the hat is hihat 1

clock.eighth -> beats.clock
fader1 -> beats.x
fader2 -> beats.y
fader3 -> beats.density
beats.kick -> kick
beats.snare -> snare
beats.hat -> hat
kick snare hat -> out
beats.accent -> leds.play

1995 ciat-lonbarde
------------------
; a rungler, xor squares, crackle and a spring. fader1 chaos, fader2 couple
the goblins are rungler 3
the pendants are xorsquares 2
the glitter is crackle
the spring is spring 2

fader1 -> goblins.chaos glitter.chaos
goblins.steps ~> pendants.pitch
fader2 -> pendants.couple
goblins -> spring
pendants ~> spring
glitter.dust -40> spring
spring -> out leds

2016 eurorack
-------------
; a cellular automaton plucks sympathetic strings; hold button1 to freeze. fader1 chord
the clock is clock 4
the pads are automaton 30
the pluck is string 4
the strings are sympathetic 2
the past is freeze 1

clock.eighth -> pads.clock
pads.pulse -> pluck
pads.cells -20> pluck.pitch
pluck -> strings
fader1 -> strings.chord
strings -> past
button1 -> past.hold
past -> out
pads.alive -> leds.track
